name 'designing-reliable-apps-postassessment-q3_2026'

question 'A developer writes a function that synchronously fetches a large dataset. While the fetch is running, a user clicks a button to dismiss a pop-up. What will the user experience?'

wrong 'The pop-up will dismiss immediately because button clicks are always prioritized over data loading'
wrong 'The app will open a new browser tab to complete the data fetch in the background'
wrong 'The app will automatically cancel the fetch to handle the user\'s click first'
right 'The button click will appear frozen and unresponsive until the synchronous fetch finishes'

allow_multiple_attempts true

teacher_markdown <<MARKDOWN
Lesson 2
MARKDOWN
